cription":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":343,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T06:28:22Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-06-21T22:14:47Z","updated_at":"2026-06-26T13:57:30Z","closed_at":"2026-06-26T13:55:24Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in: v4.4.stable.official [4c311cbee] and later\nNot reproducible in: v4.3.stable.official [77dcf97d8] and earlier.\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.stable - Linux Mint 22.3 (Zena) on X11 - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 2 monitors - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4060 Ti (nvidia; 580.159.03) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-9600K CPU @ 3.70GHz (6 threads) - 30.02 GiB memory - PulseAudio (44100 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nI was working on making an asset when I made a few constants to more easily change default values when needed. Since those Constants are irrelevant for the end user, I wanted to make them private by prefixing them with an underscore, which according to the documentation will not make it appear. However I found out that they show up regardless. I was unsure if there's some weird exception to it, but when I tried to do the same with a variable, it would not show up. Which is why I made this bug report as I believe this is unintended.\nThe only workarounds to this was to either make the const a var instead, or have the initializer be an integer value instead. Although the workaround is simple, I still believe this requires fixing.\n\n```gdscript\nclass_name Sample\nextends Node\n\nenum Rounding {\n\tFLOOR,\n\tROUND,\n\tCEIL,\n}\n\nconst _CONST_ENUM_ROUNDING := Rounding.ROUND # Shows up in documentation\nvar _var_enum_rounding := Rounding.ROUND # Does not show up in documentation\n```\n\n<img width=\"1362\" height=\"882\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/844d58ab-100d-4b8b-8ab5-50ba0d0a3688\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Create a script\n- Give it a class_name\n- Add an enum\n- Add a const variable whose default value comes from an enum. Prefix it with an underscore.\n- Open documentation of the class.\n- Variable shows up in the documentation.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nNot project dependent, but sharing a sample anyway.\n[enum_documentation_bug(4.4-copy).zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/29184409/enum_documentation_bug.4.4-copy.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120535/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120535/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}